    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok i get the binding part. so basically it's just taking up the space so nothing else can get in. what happens to the rest of the cascade if the enzyme is still there but just blocked? like how does the body react to that sudden change in angiotension levels?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
